{"n":103,"ar":"العصر","name":"Al-'Asr","mean":"The Declining Day","type":"meccan","v":[{"a":["وَٱلۡعَصۡرِ"],"w":["By the time"],"t":["wal-ʿaṣri"],"p":[1],"en":"By time"},{"a":["إِنَّ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","لَفِي","خُسۡرٍ"],"w":["Indeed","mankind","(is) surely, in","loss"],"t":["inna","l-insāna","lafī","khus'rin"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Indeed, mankind is in loss"},{"a":["إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُواْ","وَعَمِلُواْ","ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ","وَتَوَاصَوۡاْ","بِٱلۡحَقِّ","وَتَوَاصَوۡاْ","بِٱلصَّبۡرِ"],"w":["Except","those who","believe","and do","righteous deeds","and enjoin (each other)","to the truth","and enjoin (each other)","to [the] patience"],"t":["illā","alladhīna","āmanū","waʿamilū","l-ṣāliḥāti","watawāṣaw","bil-ḥaqi","watawāṣaw","bil-ṣabri"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"en":"Except for those who have believed and done righteous deeds and advised each other to truth and advised each other to patience"}]}